00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now our hearts are
completely synchronized...</font>

136
00:09:43,970 --> 00:09:47,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chakra which passes
through this thread</font>

137
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">via the Chakra Network from my heart
is controlling your heart you see.</font>

138
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use even though
it's my heart...</font>

139
00:09:56,900 --> 00:10:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my heart beat gets faster
your heart will get faster too...</font>

140
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when my heart stops beating...</font>

141
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will die too!</font>

142
00:10:10,290 --> 00:10:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't! If you stop your heart
you'll die too!</font>

143
00:10:14,090 --> 00:10:17,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
But that doesn't mean much.</font>

144
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:22,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since I've already promised
my body to Orochimaru-sama...</font>

145
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the heck are
you gonna do?!</font>

146
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I crush this heart...</font>

147
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will die too!</font>

148
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I crush this heart...</font>

149
00:11:05,430 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will die too!</font>

150
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now together we will...</font>

151
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

152
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's it feel to have
your heart seized?</font>

153
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be all right...</font>

154
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be out of your misery
right away!</font>

155
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

156
00:11:32,830 --> 00:11:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How foolish, if you kill me
Naruto will die too.</font>

157
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I'm gonna cut...</font>

158
00:11:40,050 --> 00:11:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is this!</font>

159
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no use you know</font>

160
00:11:47,890 --> 00:11:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible to cut thread formulated
and made from Chakra.</font>

161
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:02,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Tsunade-sama's great strength
wouldn't be able to break it.</font>

162
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I...
What should I do?!</font>

163
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:15,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is suffering right
in front of my eyes and yet...</font>

164
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:18,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't do anything!</font>

165
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...!</font>

166
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... absolutely will not lose!</font>

167
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until I've fulfilled my promise!</font>

168
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You bravado ends there.</font>

169
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now shall we die together?</font>

170
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And go to the place where
Sasuke is waiting?</font>

171
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

172
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

173
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sasame?!
— Sakura...</font>

174
00:13:13,310 --> 00:13:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stick this tag on a Kunai Knife!</font>

175
00:13:32,370 --> 00:13:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

176
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

177
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?!
Hey, are you okay? Naruto!</font>

178
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

179
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

180
00:13:48,930 --> 00:13:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

181
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

182
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahh... My chest right now
is beating with joy.</font>

183
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! It was a waste for me
to have worried!</font>

184
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry Sakura...</font>

185
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so worthless!</font>

186
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, Sasame!
Why are you here?</font>

187
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:30,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well it's...</font>

188
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was saved by Sasame
you know.</font>

189
00:14:34,470 --> 00:14:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too.</font>

190
00:14:36,890 --> 00:14:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

191
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water came rushing into that
trap pit we were in earlier...</font>

192
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it! The lid to the pit!</font>

193
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

194
00:15:14,470 --> 00:15:16,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the water reached
the ceiling</font>

195
00:15:16,430 --> 00:15:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I desperately tried to open the lid
but wasn't able to escape...</font>

196
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was told by Master Jiraiya
to go to where Hanzaki is.</font>

197
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I got concerned about Arashi
so I came...</font>

198
00:15:46,090 --> 00:15:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

199
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Thanks!</font>

200
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-The frog spoke...!</font>

201
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well come to think of it,</font>

202
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no way you could open the lid
of the trap by pushing on it.</font>

203
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Geez!</font>

204
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how come the thread that
I couldn't cut with the Kunai Knife</font>

205
00:16:08,530 --> 00:16:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">be cut when I wrapped it
with Sasame's tag?</font>

206
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because the Chakra Thread
is a Secret Technique</font>

207
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">within the secrets of
our Fuuma Ninja Technique...</font>

208
00:16:20,370 --> 00:16:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of the Fuuma?!</font>

209
00:16:21,500 --> 00:16:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see...
So who the hell is this?!</font>

210
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

211
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She is... from earlier!</font>

212
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mistress Kagero...</font>

213
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:51,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a Fuuma Jonin.</font>

214
00:16:52,070 --> 00:16:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame!</font>

215
00:16:55,950 --> 00:16:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame...</font>

216
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was resurrected
by Orochimaru-sama...</font>

217
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:06,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! You're being tricked
by Orochimaru!</font>

218
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is Sasuke?</font>

219
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Arashi?
Where's Sasame's cousin!</font>

220
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama is...</font>

221
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">going to raise our Fuuma clan...</font>

222
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the center stage
of Shinobi again.</font>

223
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still talking about
that stuff?!</font>

224
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least tell Sasame the truth!</font>

225
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's there! He's in there!</font>

226
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame and Arashi...
You two were so close...</font>

227
00:17:58,340 --> 00:18:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it'd be better
if you didn't see him.</font>

228
00:18:25,870 --> 00:18:27,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mistress Kagero...</font>

229
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:33,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want to do, Sasame?</font>

230
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to wait here?</font>

231
00:18:41,890 --> 00:18:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will see him!
No matter what's in store for me!</font>

232
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came all the way here
to see Arashi!</font>

233
00:18:49,770 --> 00:18:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! You've got guts!</font>

234
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go together!</font>

235
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Let's go!</font>

236
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame...</font>

237
00:19:12,250 --> 00:19:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There might be some sort of trap...</font>

238
00:19:15,250 --> 00:19:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

239
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

240
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good of you to come, Sasame...</font>

241
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

242
00:19:53,790 --> 00:19:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi...!</font>

243
00:19:57,050 --> 00:19:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi!</font>

244
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:01,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi?</font>

245
00:20:04,550 --> 00:20:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm no longer...</font>

246
00:20:07,810 --> 00:20:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi...</font>

247
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the heck is going on?!</font>

248
00:20:37,170 --> 00:20:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The skills and bodies of the Fuuma Jonin
were combined into one...</font>

249
00:20:41,420 --> 00:20:45,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I've been reborn as
the ultimate Ninja you see...</font>

250
00:20:46,780 --> 00:20:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I'll show you
my ultimate Ninjutsu... Sasame!</font>

251
00:20:55,690 --> 00:20:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... Arashi...</font>

252
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn Orochimaru!</font>

253
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not forgive him
no matter what!</font>

254
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

255
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

256
00:21:16,830 --> 00:21:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

257
00:21:16,830 --> 00:21:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

258
00:21:23,230 --> 00:21:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

259
00:21:23,230 --> 00:21:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

260
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

261
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

262
00:21:34,010 --> 00:21:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

263
00:21:34,010 --> 00:21:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

264
00:21:39,590 --> 00:21:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

265
00:21:39,630 --> 00:21:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

266
00:21:45,340 --> 00:21:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

267
00:21:45,390 --> 00:21:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

268
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

269
00:21:50,850 --> 00:21:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

270
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

271
00:21:53,690 --> 00:21:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

272
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

273
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

274
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

275
00:22:08,700 --> 00:22:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

276
00:22:12,700 --> 00:22:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

277
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

278
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

279
00:22:19,090 --> 00:22:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

280
00:22:30,810 --> 00:22:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

281
00:22:30,850 --> 00:22:34,730
