00:22:39,290 --> 00:22:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sorry... I'm sorry Naruto.</font>

283
00:22:42,250 --> 00:22:44,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I haven't been able to do anything
